pve-gpu-manager (1.1.0-5) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add one-click transactional switching from SR-IOV VFs to whole-GPU passthrough
  * Detach stopped VF consumers, remove VF profiles, and assign the PF to one VM
  * Preserve unrelated PCI devices and VFIO policy with full failure rollback
  * Treat an already-correct running whole-GPU assignment as an idempotent no-op
  * Gate B50 PF passthrough on AMD until pci=noats is active and persistent
    and lspci reports ATSCtl Enable-
  * Add owned GRUB/proxmox-boot-tool policy management without automatic reboot
  * Guard native qm/API/HA starts and replay the guards after qemu-server updates
  * Block boot guest start when persisted GPU binders or native guards fail

